{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4npe-xG5AFNu2mOu5gWX-A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:28.756648+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4npe-xG5AFNu2mOu5gWX-A","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iadGcHegc7t1oCcnW18WtpxpWlM6KT50hOfzemwRf3EW1GGcsYibLjibaUbmzCjv959CZ0k99Q966jnFKnHerS4J9GErTQic7dXj3mKyPicslVbw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3yWMia6JrBljAQmrRfK44CVLGLicg0mQ61s6rBZDmOUsZqLmoFpkqTPC3501dnthRdH5EIyNhAmou7wznd1fhH6atNszvBxLnLQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0G2DHspRTWGl5jonwsvOMnpdz8TFqEmaKBEcZeA0erawrrArO7u7icBgd8yvnc13JaNyvqicax71Zf2VRgvPsu0tc4NNp0Yicr8U/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>南京理工大学化学与化工学院</span></strong></span><span>源于1953年创办的哈尔滨军事工程学院炮兵工程系火炸药科，1988年9月成立化工学院，2021年4月更名为化学与化工学院。学院依托鲜明的学科特色，将学术立院与文化育人有机融合起来，弘扬以国家最高科技奖获得者、“工信楷模”、江苏“时代楷模”王泽山院士为代表的“一辈子只做一件事”的精神，将一代代建设者身上充分体现出的浓厚的家国情怀、强烈的社会责任感以及重道义、勇担当的优秀品格，凝塑成特有的“国之所需、吾志所向” 的学院精神。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/iadGcHegc7t1YSX5KRQvXoIwXMptg6kSPFfIPaxEIgT2lVnpLmvfZv82ubXWqh4X18I9AXBYj91evGqclIcIFIw4oWz7ZOXib3dpoQcOf7kOk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院的化学工程与技术学科在全国第五轮学科评估中位列A+，化学学科进入 ESI国际学科领域全球排名前</span><strong><em><span><span>1‰</span></span></em></strong><span>。学院拥有应用化学、材料学、军事化学与烟火技术</span><strong><em><span><span>3</span></span></em></strong><span>个国家重点学科，化学工程与技术工信部重点学科，化学工程与技术江苏高校优势学科，军事化学与烟火技术“十三五”首批国防特色学科。</span></p><p><span>学院汇聚了一支包括工程院院士、国家杰青、长江学者、万人计划领军人才等在内的高水平师资队伍，现有教职工</span><strong><em><span><span>296</span></span></em></strong><span>人，专任教师</span><strong><em><span><span>194</span></span></em></strong><span>人，教师中正高</span><strong><em><span><span>94</span></span></em></strong><span>人，副高</span><strong><em><span><span>85</span></span></em></strong><span>人。</span></p><p><span>近年来，学院呈现出跨越式发展态势，取得了以国家最高科学技术奖、 国家技术发明一等奖及在《Science》和《Nature》上发表的论文等为代表的一系列标志性成果，引领我国特种能源化工行业跻身世界先进行列。 学院拥有国家级平台</span><strong><em><span><span>8</span></span></em></strong><span>个，省部级平台</span><strong><em><span><span>17</span></span></em></strong><span>个，承担了军委创新特区重大专项、国家重点研发等重大项目</span><strong><em><span><span>100</span></span></em></strong><span>多项，年均科研经费</span><strong><em><span><span>2.5</span></span></em></strong><span>亿元。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t30MCDB704y3hFNlZdgsoL1ibVgZwNyk9SYB3HicXr3Y28iay8mP8LuonV7UxGwdPZP1aMdkB9hgu30CmYPB02icWnOxx4bVXc6OEQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3nE5qLlpUPR06zf8RciaicT8ZehWWEq2wobGLdcQxElVwuddmRPHAbS80Aqp82Dlia1icUgbHvNYdtdVNh1J2pj2ibhn8d2yu2Pk38/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>150人左右</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2026年7月1日-7月5日（不在时间范围内的申请无效）</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2027年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好（四六级成绩或其他资格考试证明）；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业与本院招生专业相近，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力。学科竞赛、科研训练已取得优良成绩者优先；已获得与本院招生专业相近的学术成果者优先；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>5</span></strong></span><strong><span>.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，学院进行资格审核，根据学科特点、开放日规模，选择一定数量学生参加开放日活动，并通过邮件方式进行通知。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请人需在2026年7月6日8:00前将申请材料（包括申请表、个人陈述、本科阶段成绩、英语水平证明及其他证明材料等）扫描合并为一个pdf，邮件主题命名格式为：“本科院校-本科专业-姓名-联系方式”发至联系邮箱yz103@njust.edu.cn。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>开放日时间暂定于7月10日，将组织学科专业介绍、实验室云参观等活动，详细活动日程安排以后续实际通知为准。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>王老师</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>联系电话</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>025-84315506</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>电子邮箱</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>yz103@njust.edu.cn</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名人员加群（QQ）</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2R5Y6z3nt5U0gpwAxUDlnPllLuhpiaNALNM0OI67Hho3XMrXkuVud8jibhsSghsdcY0dTUY3fxwBxh3zXiczmGPuZoDrwl1p4WTM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0PP8yqITAvgA9pAFhNXDI4b939DEenzQgMueC6cBRLqbiaXXw35ShngliaZj4gWXH6OzPia61nXtYMAbxg6eTvn1ibztTDOQF7iaMI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>出品 | 南京理工大学研招办</span></p><p><span>来源 | 化学与化工学院</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 吴雅琪</span></p><p><span>初审 | 秦俊华 化学与化工学院</span></p><p><span>审核 | 于雷</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1BE7NpHMzfUcqLsgY0s1sB6PChv3TcHFIv0oSqhic9mhPnwdthH9hWa5ncONdsUvYr55XgY8OoM0YAGxAseFbF3ebIreibgmrs4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"294f517912999168e0d43c047975c7438bf3ec3b8985493aa4d0d8423c6b6cbc","textLength":1290,"sourceSha256":"3e55e9a99f5e0d4a76ee7113a6098b3d985db7801d787536f144a2282abfea01","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4ba8917bbe563061fa93","title":"2026年南京理工大学化学与化工学院2026年全国“优秀大学生”校园开放日活动公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:28.756648+00:00"}
